Changes by iTuner: PCM16 WAV loading with the standard library, and NumPy
hanning in place of SciPy hann (symmetric window). This removes the extra
SoundFile/libsndfile and SciPy dependencies; the decoding algorithm is intact.
The integration reuses the trusted-mode/quality checks from the local P4
ft8hub_decode_sstv_daemon.py, with strict VIS parity and no guessed modes.
The package initializer omits the unused upstream command-line frontend.
